# OCR Service - Test Data Tables .gitignore

# Exclude binary document files containing tables to prevent repository bloat
# These files should be downloaded separately or generated during test setup

# Document files
*.pdf
*.PDF
*.tiff
*.TIFF
*.tif
*.TIF
*.png
*.PNG
*.jpg
*.JPG
*.jpeg
*.JPEG

# Exclude generated OCR output files
*.csv
*.json
*.xml

# Exception: Do not ignore these files
!README.md
!metadata.json
!table_samples.md
!download_test_data.sh
!generate_test_data.py
!table_formats.json

# Instructions for obtaining test documents:
# 1. Run the download_test_data.sh script to fetch standard test documents from the project's data repository
# 2. For custom test cases, place your table documents in this directory manually
# 3. Use generate_test_data.py to create synthetic test tables with controlled variations
#
# Note: Test data should include various table formats:
# - Simple tables with clear borders
# - Complex tables with merged cells
# - Tables with varying font sizes and styles
# - Low-quality scanned tables
# - Tables with handwritten entries
# - Financial tables with currency values
# - Tables embedded in larger documents